From 95d34e7aedddce40db7f7d220c1137bf1b363731 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <claude@users.invalid>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 04:17:26 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 01/10] VPVulkan: Vulkan 1.3 surface for Source 2 (1.1/1.2/1.3
 feature and property structs, depth/stencil resolve, image format list,
 separate stencil usage, swapchain mutable format)

apiVersion and vkEnumerateInstanceVersion report 1.3. vkGetPhysicalDeviceFeatures2/Properties2
fill the Vulkan11/12/13 structs and their extension forms from one description of what the
driver really does. vkCreateDevice accepts the 1.x feature structs and logs (vk.feature) every
enabled feature the driver lacks instead of refusing the device (Alyx enables tessellation,
depthBounds, shaderInt64... without using them on this path).

New extensions: maintenance2/3, image_format_list, separate_stencil_usage,
swapchain_mutable_format, depth_stencil_resolve, driver_properties, and the promoted names
Source 2 enables. Depth resolve (render pass 2 and dynamic rendering) reaches Metal's
depthResolveFilter (sample 0 / min / max). Mutable-format images get PixelFormatView.
maxPerStageDescriptorSamplers 64 (argument tables; Alyx sets hold 17).

Tests: gpu_vulkan.alyx (Alyx's captured device), gpu_vulkan.depth_resolve.

